Test-time augmentation (TTA) implementation significantly enhances prediction reliability across all test samples. Eight-fold geometric augmentation (rotation, reflection) improves accuracy by 2.3\% on average while reducing uncertainty by 22.4\%. This ensemble approach provides robust prediction intervals with accuracy gains ranging from 1.5\% to 3.0\% across different samples, confirming the value of TTA for operational snow monitoring applications.

