FTransUNet \cite{ma2024multilevel} & 160.88 & -- & -- & -- & 91.53 & -- & 92.49 \\


\textbf{XFuse (Ours)} & 47.1M & \textbf{13.77} & \textbf{0.180} & \textbf{23.65} & \textbf{94.66} & \textbf{93.90} & \textbf{78.71} \\
